# Rules for Cline — see AGENTS.md, docs/AGENT_GUIDE.md and docs/ARCHITECTURE.md for full context.

- Next.js 15 App Router + React 19 + Tailwind CSS v4 + TypeScript strict.
- DO NOT add output: "export" to next.config.ts; production builds output to .next/ (not out/).
- Offline-first: all user state in localStorage. Never add remote DBs/auth/telemetry.
- Persian (RTL) vs English (LTR): code blocks, inline code, tables are ALWAYS LTR/left-aligned; Persian headings/paragraphs RTL/right-aligned.
- AI calls (Gemini) are server-only via app/api routes; never expose GEMINI_API_KEY client-side; always provide offline fallback.
- Icons: named imports from lucide-react. Animations: motion/react.
- New books go through scripts/pipeline (npm run book:*) and MUST be registered in data/sampleBooks.ts.
- Verification: run npm run lint first (~2s), and npm run build at the end (~40s).
